// Your script from lesson 1, ready for the seeker's rewards.
script "My hide and seek" for hideseek v1

// hideseek-starter sees eight distance rays, its speed, whether the other
// player is in sight, whether it is the prep phase and the nearest ramp.
brain hideseek-starter

// Runs for every player, hider and seeker, 30 times per second.
each tick {
